<title>USA: Pa. housing bonds repriced, top yld still 6.15 pct.</title>
<headline>Pa. housing bonds repriced, top yld still 6.15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Tuesday it repriced and restructured Pennsylvania Housing Finance Agency's $75 million mortgage revenue bond issue, adjusting yields in several maturities but leaving the top tax-exempt yield in 2027 unchanged at 6.15 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
