<p>$60,000,000 SERIES 1996-53A BONDS (AMT)</p>
<p>$15,000,000 SERIES 1996-53B BONDS (FED. TAXABLE)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING AND RESTRUCTURING.</p>
